From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: decode in stage 1 when decode order is requested

Stage 2 pipelines bitstream parsing and pixel decode across frames, so
each frame is returned later. Use stage 1 for sessions that ask for
decode order output.
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
index 990fce2..29b7fc5 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
@@ -552,7 +552,8 @@ int iris_set_stage(struct iris_inst *inst, enum platform_inst_fw_cap_type cap_id
 	u32 work_mode = STAGE_2;
 
 	if (inst->domain == DECODER) {
-		if (iris_res_is_less_than(width, height, 1280, 720))
+		if (iris_res_is_less_than(width, height, 1280, 720) ||
+		    iris_dec_decode_order(inst))
 			work_mode = STAGE_1;
 	}
 
